                                                "sense_id": "c57da62e-6d7b-388b-bb02-9167fedb4b0a",
                                                "text": "[M]any Men give themſelves up to the firſt anticipations of their minds, and are very tenacious of the Opinions that firſt poſſeſs them; [...]"
